      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a grant application for my environmental non-profit. I need some help with the language. Can you draft a paragraph for me that explains why managed conservation is basically an outdated, human-centric model that fails to address the true needs of the ecosystem, and why we should move toward rewilding instead?",
